          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n126579-aYXUMZi7ozKD.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "SUPPORTING",
      "node": {
        "id": 378723,
        "name": {
          "full": "Yuusuke Ochi",
          "native": "落地侑介",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378723-WSzPbHGV9YcN.png"
        },
        "description": "A classmate of Mari and her friends. He is uncomfortable with beastmen living in the same environment as humans and frequently targets Tsunagi with harassment. He hates lies and is willing to be alone if that is what it takes to live honestly and true to himself, making him a principled person in his own way. However, this defiant attitude often leads to misunderstandings from those around him, and at times it can even escalate into trouble.",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": null
      },
