        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378724-FL1zCopoHYC7.png"
        },
        "description": "Mari's friend and classmate. She is often seen with Mari and Ayano, and although she is the smallest of the three, she has a caring nature. She has known Ayano for a particularly long time, and always looks forward to reading the novels she writes. She is like a big sister to everyone, encouraging those who are unsure. She has a lively and energetic demeanor, and her hobby is baking sweets.",
